#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:8
msgid "零拷贝"
msgstr "Zero-Copy"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:10
msgid "使用 `<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>` 在调用者提供的可写存储中构造单帧非可靠消息。PHY 在返回前完成读取或复制。"
msgstr ""
"Use `<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>` to build one unreliable frame in writable caller storage. The PHY finishes "
"reading or copying the buffer before returning."

