#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:19
msgid "可靠发送使用 `xgl_send_at()`。认证发送要求已为选定的目标、connection ID 与 session epoch 安装可信会话。"
msgstr ""
"Use `xgl_send_at()` for reliable transmission. For authenticated sends, install a trusted session for "
"the selected destination, connection ID and session epoch first."

