#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:35
msgid ""
"Connection ID 位于基础头中，不增加扩展字节。应用通过 `xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()` 获取布局，避免自行重复计算。`data_offset` 必须等于 "
"`layout.payload_offset`，`buffer_size` 必须覆盖 `layout.frame_size`。完整帧同时满足路由 MTU 和实例帧长限制。协议写入头部与尾部，载荷地址保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"The connection ID is carried in the base header and adds no extension bytes. Obtain the layout from "
"`xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()` instead of duplicating these calculations in application code. "
"`data_offset` must equal `layout.payload_offset`, and `buffer_size` must cover `layout.frame_size`. The "
"complete frame must fit both the route MTU and the instance frame limit. The stack writes the header and"
" trailer; the payload remains at its original address."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:37
msgid "规划并发送"
msgstr "Plan and Send"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:39
msgid "下面的 C11 示例要求实例已初始化并配置到节点 2 的路由。如果要求认证，应先安装对应的可信会话，再查询布局。"
msgstr ""
"The following C11 example assumes an initialized instance with a route to node 2. If authentication is "
"required, install the corresponding trusted session before querying the layout."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:72
msgid ""
"查询忽略 `buffer`、`buffer_size` 和 `data_offset`，但 `data_len` 必须非零。失败时输出布局清零。查询不分配内存、不调用安全 provider 或 "
"PHY、不更新发送统计，也不消耗安全序号。查询成功不预留资源，实际发送仍会重新检查当前路由、容量与安全状态。"
msgstr ""
"The query ignores `buffer`, `buffer_size` and `data_offset`; `data_len` must be nonzero. It clears the "
"output layout on failure. It does not allocate, call the security provider or PHY, update transmission "
"statistics, or consume a security sequence. A successful query reserves no resources. The eventual send "
"revalidates the current route, limits and security state."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:74
msgid "所有权"
msgstr "Ownership"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:75
msgid "发送返回后，调用者即可复用存储。所有回调均同步借用缓冲区。此接口减少组帧复制，驱动仍可能需要复制到自有 DMA 缓冲。不得保存借用指针，也不得传入只读存储。"
msgstr ""
"The caller may reuse the buffer once the send returns. All callbacks borrow the buffer synchronously. "
"This interface saves a framing copy; a driver may still need to copy into its own DMA buffer. Pass "
"writable storage and release borrowed pointers when the callback returns."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:78
msgid "失败处理"
msgstr "Failure Handling"

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:80
msgid ""
"检查返回值。本地成功不能证明远端交付，失败也可能已经修改头部与尾部。认证发送一旦预留安全序号，后续 provider 或 PHY 失败不会回退该序号；重试应再次调用 "
"API，不能重放之前序列化的帧。详见[安全机制](../reference/protocol/v1/security.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Check the returned status. A local success is not evidence of remote delivery. A failure can leave the "
"header and trailer modified. Once an authenticated send reserves a security sequence, later provider or "
"PHY failure does not roll it back; retry through the API instead of replaying the previously serialized "
"bytes. See [Security](../reference/protocol/v1/security.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/in-place-send.md:82
msgid ""
"调用、查询与重试均遵循实例串行化规则。布局查询和基础描述符校验阶段的拒绝不构成发送尝试；进入统一 network "
"发送路径后的错误按[统计契约](../reference/statistics.md)计数，不能只凭返回错误码判断失败阶段。"
msgstr ""
"Calls, queries and retries must follow the instance's serialization rules. A layout query or rejection "
"during basic descriptor validation is not a transmission attempt. Errors after entering the common "
"network send path are counted according to the [statistics contract](../reference/statistics.md); the "
"returned error code alone does not identify which validation stage failed."
